{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0614_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f2281abf550e5db83616c31a080dfdcc278217e1eda523ec1ceedf4ed39a86b0", "ja": "（朋花がプロデュースした服のPR撮影に来た。\n撮影前日の早朝、朋花に起こされた……）", "zh": "（我是来拍摄朋花设计的服装宣传照的。\n拍摄前一天一大早，朋花把我叫醒了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0614_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "e1de438f8fbba1a3ab68cf690e5d0e69d451259c318d21b0d1e9fac264ad674d", "ja": "{$P$}さん、準備はできましたね～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，都准备好了吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0614_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4d30de600e4e0eb0ad3087985438234eb50919c7b218f61def691696e858d3af", "ja": "ああ、バッチリだ。でも朋花？\nこんなに早い時間から、本当にお参りに行くのか？", "zh": "啊，准备得相当充分。不过，朋花？\n真的要这么早就去参拜吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0614_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "61d7eae460dc108b3a7fac917ae403050dec59d9394112741d4a6b4366f7e69f", "ja": "もちろんです～。\n今日のお参りは、できるだけ人を避けておきたくて。", "zh": "当然啦～。\n今天去参拜，我想尽可能避开人群。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0614_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c34a040aaed389a0c4edfc1a0b0e82981761f215c2980d6137466bf9d332a69a", "ja": "人を……？", "zh": "人……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0614_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "475821e128b28091123650a00c1279d99ee951775f277d603319a0fff6b6dbfd", "ja": "ええ。雰囲気を掴むためというのもありますが……\nまずは、ご挨拶をするのが先だと思うんです。", "zh": "是的。虽然也是为了把握氛围……\n但我觉得，首先还是应该先打个招呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0614_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "930b80f3a26b0017d8e5935d5be128d3ade2f89b56c7cc73e67ffa2e3be76b74", "ja": "暮らしている場所に、勝手に入って撮影などされたら\nやはりいい気分ではありませんからね。", "zh": "如果有人擅自闯入自己居住的地方拍摄什么的，心里总归是不舒服的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0614_1007_p", "source_sha256": "5a06286702181952bbfe8df4ed72f821b094a1f8bebb4766157ad2e0e8a23f4c", "ja": "なるほど……。さすが朋花だな。\n神様への配慮は、ちょっと思いつかなかったよ。", "zh": "原来如此……不愧是朋花啊。\n我还真没想到要顾及神明。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0614_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "11e4455f165b55c999615efacc06176dfae1d2546a60e7a170d9dcc798899743", "ja": "まだまだですね～。まあ、撮影の下見や\n普通の参拝とは、少し違いますから仕方ありません。", "zh": "还差得远呢～毕竟这和拍摄踩点或普通参拜不太一样，没办法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0614_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "9b947c34526f5a05010b3af423d0ce4590d6bb1f8a8d6c58d89517cb4ccaf01b", "ja": "相手が誰であろうと、\n礼儀を欠くことは失礼にあたりますからね。", "zh": "不论对方是谁，失了礼数都是很不礼貌的行为。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0614_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "14b4be95f5a843552a50f0ae40144995a72c2e387921b49d15e723d2b0855256", "ja": "参拝する方々のご迷惑にならないように行くのも\n当然のことです～。", "zh": "当然也要注意别给前来参拜的人们添麻烦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0614_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e7f11078241a4f153e30d15d36087fc52b1c282682ec925e64817ac60c5d373d", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\n朋花の言うとおり、まだまだだったよ……。", "zh": "啊，是啊。\n正如朋花所说，还远远不够……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0614_1012_031tom", "source_sha256": "8b85135513f3d45a77ee86d08f9aba408424e7bb4e7ac92d9549fcb52ee73263", "ja": "そうですね。成長なき者は、聖母のそばには\n必要ありません。そのことを留めておいてください。", "zh": "是啊。没有成长的人，不需要待在圣母身边。请记住这一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0614_1013_p", "source_sha256": "6c42d5ba416a6378a26e8ed0517e3576242ca33318a5fa1f0d9e417b0097c0d3", "ja": "うっ……。わかったよ。", "zh": "呜……我知道了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0614_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "308d7c23693c42f05ea5a5f47ee2d437576b2c5365c47e98041b260a8a28db13", "ja": "ですが……この服が満足のいく仕上がりになったのは\n{$P$}さんのおかげです。", "zh": "可是……这套服装能有令人满意的成品，多亏了\n{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0614_1015_031tom", "source_sha256": "0ab79731a3bec10f1a6b424a96a7574abd9242b2f33c3ef49a1129cce3a57700", "ja": "だからこそ……\nこれからも聖母のために、期待していますよ～？", "zh": "正因如此……\n今后也要继续为了圣母而努力，期待你的表现哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0614_1016_p", "source_sha256": "8796df5e23a0a1d00b6b991b43eeebf365c1fc628369eea1f5a1b7656bee0aa4", "ja": "もちろんだ！　朋花の愛を子豚ちゃんたちに\n届けるために……今後も頑張るよ。", "zh": "那是当然！为了把朋花的爱传递给\n小猪崽们……今后我也会加油的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0614_1017_031tom", "source_sha256": "db0e05c25d2ee236b2f83cbf62298b31763781ba0f3d92dd92a652a3f9cc3c63", "ja": "うふふっ♪　その誓い、必ず守ってくださいね～。", "zh": "呵呵♪ 这个誓言，一定要遵守哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0614_1018_p", "source_sha256": "53c6e5ba4fa62a61fbc6b592b4c7bfe8ba74f53b76c6e16dcd84c93bd351a4c3", "ja": "任せてくれ！　とりあえず、目先の目標として\n朋花の服のPRを成功させることだな！", "zh": "交给我吧！眼下的目标，就是成功完成朋花服装的宣传！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0614_1019_031tom", "source_sha256": "72f5bb9f8ac790415a16cc9e565a4f57d48e740e122cc562a8b2aee3d907ca5c", "ja": "ええ。ではお参りの時に、\n撮影が順調に進むようにお願いしてみましょうか。", "zh": "嗯。那么，我们去参拜时，就祈求拍摄能够顺利进行吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0614_1020_031tom", "source_sha256": "d6c96bb5fd8a8923f0a126bb76f7c287544068a7008efe97a5a051cdddc0fada", "ja": "さあ、{$P$}さん。\n人が増える前に、早く行きますよ～。", "zh": "那么，{$P$}先生。趁人还没变多，我们快点过去吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
